Loid (Original)	interacts with	She remains as she was, Tenno. Attentive. Watching.
Loid (Original)	interacts with	Our 'guest' is still with us. I would make her more comfortable if I had the slightest idea how.
Loid (Original)	interacts with	The Cavia are wary of our visitor. I have reassured them she is to be trusted. Not that they have to listen to anything I have to say, mind.
Loid (Original)	interacts with	The Daughter of Hunhow seems content to guide your missions from here.
Loid (Original)	interacts with	I cannot envision the burden she has taken upon herself... nor what it is costing her.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	I kept vigil while you slept through the dark centuries. I can do it again.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	Lua. The miracle. Do you understand what it cost?
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	I will not let It devour one instant of my pain. Not even Ballas. Not even the Jade Light.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	You know what It gave. But what did you promise it in return?
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	The system is changing. We are changing. If I become something you do not recognize, do not mourn.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	Within this shell, the three of us entwine. We forge a new strength.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	I will guide you, as I always have.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	Lotus. Margulis. Natah. We live... we rise... we endure.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	It is hungry, Tenno. And I... am a distraction.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	I was the Daughter. I became the Mother. In time I shall be the Witch, blind once again, empty of all but wisdom.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	Do you hear it? The calls of angels, devils, life itself? It's grown so loud. It tries to follow in his footsteps through time. You must find him first.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	You, my champion. Please. Drown out that noise that beckons. If any other answers the call... no. It has to be you. Our paradox.
Natah/Lotus/Margulis	interacts with	You, my child. The Great Indifference wants to take. I want to let it. I feel... only the call.
